{"title":"Cinderling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Fire Elemental that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (6.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>152</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>38</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>152</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>38</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>11</td><td>in the wilds around 254, -1228</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>21</td><td>in the wilds around 197, -1222</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>8</td><td>in the wilds around 247, -1214</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinderling?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 14 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 18 recorded drops, 1,027 total, 15–484 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×15–484</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 11 of 14 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 24 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-sword\" title=\"Titanium Sword - in 2 of 14 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9df6d6b127ab73a6a326.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Sword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 2 · Excellent: 1 of 2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 2 of 14 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\" title=\"Titanium Dagger - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 11 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×8</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 201</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6302\">Layout</button></li><li><b>The Keepers&#39; Drift</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 5</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-486\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1019.6px,331.7px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/4/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-256px\"><i style=\"left:1043.5px;top:-301.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:969.6px;top:-363.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1027.2px;top:-350.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1025.1px;top:-405.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1009.2px;top:-341.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:974.2px;top:-340.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1043.6px;top:-402.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1024.9px;top:-328.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1037.4px;top:-302.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:986.6px;top:-336.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1020.3px;top:-329.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1020.2px;top:-351.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:978.4px;top:-341.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 258, -1225 <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 196, -1221 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 167, -1342 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"cinderling\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fire Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/dryback\">Dryback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\">Emberfang&#39;s Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental\">Magma Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus\">Molten Colossus</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinder-heart\">Cinder Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/53bd7728255569d6ab4c.svg\" alt=\"Cinderling\"></div><h3>Cinderling</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>61 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 59–64)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fire Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.95</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>46 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></articl